And I think we probably did that thing where you punch the thing you're scared of when you write this other shiny, your fun standalone, maybe that's what we did.
我想我们大概做了那种事，就是当你对某事感到害怕时，你会通过写另一个更闪耀、更有趣的独立故事去宣泄，也许这就是我们做的。

00:05:47.990 --> 00:05:48.829
