I'm trying to think of how to answer Jordan as other part of the question, which is like can we remember moments like that?
我正在想要怎么回答乔安娜提出的另一个问题，也就是我们是否能想起类似那样的时刻？

00:47:40.880 --> 00:47:44.639
I'm just thinking about it as it pertains to the show.
我只是在结合这部剧来思考这个问题。

00:47:44.639 --> 00:47:52.880
I think the entire endeavor of launching the show, Carter and I were essentially drunk with our own lack of experience.
我认为推出这部剧的整个过程，我和卡特基本上都是因为我们缺乏经验而感到有些飘飘然。

00:47:52.880 --> 00:47:55.639
Meaning we had no idea how to write a sitcom.
意思是说我们根本不知道怎么写一部情景喜剧。

00:47:55.639 --> 00:48:00.039
We had never even written on a set proper, like multi-camera sitcom.
我们甚至从来没有在真正的片场写过剧本，比如多机位的情景喜剧。

00:48:00.039 --> 00:48:07.039
And I think the sort of like way we just staggered through, kind of season one, we're just like, we're gonna write it like a soap.
我想我们在第一季里跌跌撞撞地摸索着前行，当时我们的想法就是，我们要把它写得像肥皂剧一样。

00:48:07.039 --> 00:48:08.719
But we're gonna write it like it's a drama.
但我们要把它写得像一部正剧。

00:48:08.719 --> 00:48:09.920
It's gonna have cliffhangers.
它会有悬念。

00:48:09.920 --> 00:48:12.960
you're going to have to watch, there will be these throughlines.
你必须追看下去，会有这样的一些贯穿线。

00:48:12.960 --> 00:48:26.920
We knew season one would end with this crazy sort of like, again, we're trying to, it's not too many spoilers, but like something buoyant and full of elation and also full of heartbreak on the sort of two-sided coin that ends season one.
我们知道第一季会以一种疯狂的方式结束，再次说明，我们尽量避免剧透，但就像是某种充满活力、欣喜若狂，同时也充满心碎的感觉，这就是第一季结尾那枚硬币的两面。

00:48:26.920 --> 00:48:32.400
And Carter, don't you look at it as though we were like, we just didn't know enough to be afraid.
卡特，你不觉得当时我们就是那种状态吗，我们只是初生牛犊不怕虎。

00:48:32.400 --> 00:48:34.320
We didn't know enough.
我们懂得太少了。

00:48:34.320 --> 00:48:39.519
We sort of were like, we had turned off the part of our brains that thought, we can't do this.
我们差不多就是，关掉了大脑里那些想着“我们做不到”的部分。

00:48:39.519 --> 00:48:43.760
what we wanted to write, it was, the whole show was kind of us doing the Pineapple Incidentally.
我们想写的东西，整部剧其实就跟我们拍“菠萝”那集一样随性而为。

00:48:43.760 --> 00:48:59.471
Yeah, well there certainly wasn't, there wasn't a feeling, like I vividly remember this, and I can be neurotic about a million things in my life, but I remember just with absolute clarity feeling like this show is gonna go the distance, like from right from the beginning.
对，当然没有那种感觉，我对此记忆犹新，我生活中可以为数百万事情感到神经质，但我唯独记得非常清楚，从一开始我就有一种绝对坚定的感觉，觉得这部剧能一直走下去。

00:48:59.471 --> 00:49:08.539
And I've been on other shows where I thought that, but I always kind of like thought like, you know, it's probably I'm probably gonna get canceled and I did.
